  'Di Mac: System Settings → General → Sharing → Remote Login aktif. Pasang Xcode, Flutter, CocoaPods (dan fastlane untuk kirim review otomatis). Lalu isi host, user, password di Pengaturan dan klik "Tes SSH MacBook".': 'On the Mac: System Settings → General → Sharing → enable Remote Login. Install Xcode, Flutter, CocoaPods (and fastlane for automatic review submission). Then fill in host, user, password in Settings and click "Test MacBook SSH".',
  'Daftarkan Bundle ID + buat aplikasi di App Store Connect': 'Register Bundle ID + create the app in App Store Connect',
  'Sekali saja, manual: developer.apple.com → Identifiers → daftarkan Bundle ID ({0}). Lalu App Store Connect → Apps → + → New App, pilih Bundle ID tersebut.': 'Once, manually: developer.apple.com → Identifiers → register the Bundle ID ({0}). Then App Store Connect → Apps → + → New App and choose that Bundle ID.',
  'Atur signing di Xcode (sekali)': 'Set up signing in Xcode (once)',
  'Di MacBook buka ios/Runner.xcworkspace → Runner → Signing & Capabilities → centang "Automatically manage signing" dan pilih Team. Login Apple ID di Xcode → Settings → Accounts.': 'On the MacBook open ios/Runner.xcworkspace → Runner → Signing & Capabilities → tick "Automatically manage signing" and choose the Team. Sign in with your Apple ID in Xcode → Settings → Accounts.',
  'Deploy mode TestFlight. Build diproses Apple 5–30 menit lalu muncul di App Store Connect → TestFlight.': 'Deploy in TestFlight mode. Apple processes the build in 5–30 minutes, then it appears in App Store Connect → TestFlight.',
  'Deploy ke TestFlight': 'Deploy to TestFlight',
  'Uji lewat TestFlight': 'Test via TestFlight',
  'App Store Connect → TestFlight → Internal Testing → tambahkan tester (maks 100, langsung tanpa review). Tester install aplikasi TestFlight di iPhone lalu install aplikasimu. Untuk tester luar (External) perlu Beta App Review.': 'App Store Connect → TestFlight → Internal Testing → add testers (up to 100, no review). Testers install the TestFlight app on iPhone, then install your app. External testers need Beta App Review.',
  'Sudah diuji': 'Tested',
  'Isi informasi App Store': 'Fill in App Store information',
  'App Store Connect → aplikasi → versi: screenshot iPhone 6.7" / 6.5", deskripsi, kata kunci, URL support & kebijakan privasi, App Privacy, Age Rating, dan App Review Information (akun demo + catatan untuk reviewer).': 'App Store Connect → app → version: iPhone 6.7" / 6.5" screenshots, description, keywords, support & privacy policy URLs, App Privacy, Age Rating, and App Review Information (demo account + notes for the reviewer).',
  'Salin akun demo & link': 'Copy demo account & links',
  'Kirim untuk review App Store': 'Submit for App Store review',
  'Deploy mode App Store: IPA produksi diupload dan otomatis dikirim untuk review (butuh fastlane di MacBook). Apple biasanya mereview 1–2 hari.': 'App Store mode deploy: the production IPA is uploaded and automatically submitted for review (needs fastlane on the MacBook). Apple usually reviews in 1–2 days.',
  'Disetujui & rilis ke publik': 'Approved & released to the public',
  'Setelah status "Pending Developer Release", klik "Release This Version" di App Store Connect. Aplikasi tampil di App Store untuk semua orang (biasanya dalam 24 jam).': 'Once the status is "Pending Developer Release", click "Release This Version" in App Store Connect. The app appears on the App Store for everyone (usually within 24 hours).',
