  'Cara mengambil SHA-1': 'How to get the SHA-1',
  'Di mana ambilnya? Klik untuk langkah-langkahnya. Boleh dikosongkan dulu kalau belum pernah upload AAB.': 'Where do I get it? Click for the steps. You can leave it empty until you have uploaded an AAB.',
  'Cara mengambil SHA-1 App signing key': 'How to get the App signing key SHA-1',
  'Penting: SHA-1 ini baru muncul SETELAH kamu upload AAB pertama ke Play Console (misalnya ke Pengujian internal). Kalau belum pernah upload, kosongkan dulu, deploy dulu, lalu kembali ke sini.': 'Important: this SHA-1 only appears AFTER you upload your first AAB to Play Console (e.g. to Internal testing). If you have not uploaded yet, leave it empty, deploy first, then come back here.',
  'play.google.com/console → klik aplikasi kamu (mis. batamchitchat).': 'play.google.com/console → click your app (e.g. batamchitchat).',
  'Menu kiri: "Uji dan rilis"': 'Left menu: "Test and release"',
  'Klik "Uji dan rilis" supaya submenunya terbuka, lalu gulir ke bawah sampai bagian "Penyiapan aplikasi" / "Setup".': 'Click "Test and release" to expand it, then scroll down to the "App setup" / "Setup" section.',
  'Klik "Integritas aplikasi"': 'Click "App integrity"',
  'Di halaman Integritas aplikasi, klik tab / tombol "Penandatanganan aplikasi Play" (App signing). Kadang ada tombol "Setelan" di kartu Penandatanganan aplikasi Play.': 'On the App integrity page, open the "Play app signing" tab. Sometimes there is a "Settings" button on the Play app signing card.',
  'Salin SHA-1 di "Sertifikat kunci penandatanganan aplikasi"': 'Copy the SHA-1 under "App signing key certificate"',
  'Ada dua kotak: "Sertifikat kunci penandatanganan aplikasi" (App signing key) dan "Sertifikat kunci upload" (Upload key). Salin baris "Sidik jari sertifikat SHA-1" dari kotak PERTAMA.': 'There are two boxes: "App signing key certificate" and "Upload key certificate". Copy the "SHA-1 certificate fingerprint" line from the FIRST box.',
  'Tempel di DeployHub': 'Paste it into DeployHub',
  'Tempel di kolom SHA-1 lalu Simpan. Lewat "Siapkan Firebase" langkah 5, SHA-1 ini otomatis didaftarkan ke Firebase.': 'Paste it into the SHA-1 field and Save. Step 5 of "Set up Firebase" registers it with Firebase automatically.',
  'Contoh bentuknya:': 'Example format:',
  'Kenapa perlu? Google menandatangani ulang aplikasimu dengan kunci miliknya. Kalau SHA-1 kunci itu tidak didaftarkan di Firebase, Login Google gagal (error 10) di aplikasi yang diinstall dari Play Store, padahal di debug lancar. SHA-1 kunci upload kamu sudah dibaca otomatis dari keystore.': 'Why? Google re-signs your app with its own key. If the SHA-1 of that key is not registered in Firebase, Google Sign-In fails (error 10) in the Play Store install even though debug works. Your upload key SHA-1 is already read from your keystore automatically.',
  'Buat AAB saja (tanpa upload)': 'Build AAB only (no upload)',
  'Buat IPA saja (tanpa upload)': 'Build IPA only (no upload)',
  'Masih ada pipeline yang berjalan. Tunggu selesai dulu.': 'A pipeline is still running. Wait for it to finish.',
  'Isi dulu folder project di MacBook dan Bundle ID di langkah iOS.': 'Fill in the MacBook project folder and Bundle ID in the iOS step first.',
  'Lokasi file (opsional)': 'File location (optional)',
  'Biarkan kosong kalau file sudah ada di folder project (status di atas ✔). Pilih file hanya kalau file itu sengaja tidak disimpan di git / di folder lain. Saat build, DeployHub menyalinnya ke tempat yang benar.': 'Leave empty if the file is already in the project folder (status above ✔). Only pick a file if it is deliberately kept out of git / in another folder. DeployHub copies it to the right place when building.',
  'google-services.json (Android) — tujuan: android/app/': 'google-services.json (Android) — goes to: android/app/',
  'GoogleService-Info.plist (iOS) — tujuan: ios/Runner/': 'GoogleService-Info.plist (iOS) — goes to: ios/Runner/',
  'SHA-1 dari Google Play (diisi setelah upload pertama)': 'SHA-1 from Google Play (fill in after the first upload)',
  'Package "com.example..." DITOLAK Google Play dan tidak bisa diganti setelah upload pertama. Ganti dulu sebelum membuat AAB, misalnya com.batamchitchat.app: ubah applicationId (dan namespace) di android/app/build.gradle, lalu daftarkan ulang di Firebase.': 'Package "com.example..." is REJECTED by Google Play and cannot be changed after the first upload. Change it before building the AAB, e.g. com.batamchitchat.app: edit applicationId (and namespace) in android/app/build.gradle, then register it again in Firebase.',
  'Urutan yang benar (ikuti dari atas)': 'The right order (follow from the top)',
  'Firebase adalah layanan Google untuk login, chat, notifikasi, dll. Aplikasimu butuh file konfigurasi supaya tahu project Firebase mana yang dipakai. Tanpa file itu build gagal atau aplikasi langsung crash saat dibuka.': 'Firebase is the Google service for login, chat, notifications, etc. Your app needs config files to know which Firebase project to use. Without them the build fails or the app crashes on launch.',
  'Buat file konfigurasi Firebase': 'Create the Firebase config files',
  'Klik "Siapkan Firebase". DeployHub membuat google-services.json, GoogleService-Info.plist dan firebase_options.dart, lalu mendaftarkan SHA-1 kunci upload (keystore) kamu. Login Google sudah jalan di HP-mu sendiri setelah ini.': 'Click "Set up Firebase". DeployHub creates google-services.json, GoogleService-Info.plist and firebase_options.dart, then registers your upload key (keystore) SHA-1. Google Sign-In then works on your own phone.',
  'Buat file AAB / IPA dulu': 'Build the AAB / IPA first',
  'Build aplikasi tanpa upload untuk memastikan semuanya lolos (signing, Firebase, R8). Hasilnya: build/app/outputs/bundle/release/app-release.aab di folder project. IPA dibuat di MacBook lalu disalin ke PC.': 'Build without uploading to make sure everything passes (signing, Firebase, R8). Output: build/app/outputs/bundle/release/app-release.aab in the project folder. The IPA is built on the MacBook and copied to the PC.',
  'Buat AAB sekarang': 'Build AAB now',
  'Buat IPA sekarang': 'Build IPA now',
  'Upload AAB pertama ke Pengujian internal': 'Upload the first AAB to Internal testing',
  'Dari halaman Proyek: "Deploy ke Play Store" → Internal, atau menu ⋮ → "Upload file AAB / IPA langsung" untuk file dari langkah 2. Saat upload pertama Google membuat kunci penandatanganan (App signing key) untuk aplikasimu.': 'From the Projects page: "Deploy to Play Store" → Internal, or menu ⋮ → "Upload AAB / IPA file directly" for the file from step 2. On the first upload Google creates the App signing key for your app.',
  'Ambil SHA-1 App signing dari Play Console': 'Get the App signing SHA-1 from Play Console',
  'Play Console → Uji dan rilis → Integritas aplikasi → Penandatanganan aplikasi Play → salin SHA-1 di kotak "Sertifikat kunci penandatanganan aplikasi". Tempel di kolom SHA-1 di bawah.': 'Play Console → Test and release → App integrity → Play app signing → copy the SHA-1 in the "App signing key certificate" box. Paste it into the SHA-1 field below.',
  'Lihat langkah lengkap': 'See full steps',
  'Daftarkan SHA-1 itu ke Firebase': 'Register that SHA-1 with Firebase',
  'Buka "Siapkan Firebase" lagi → langkah 5 "Daftarkan SHA-1". Setelah itu Login Google juga jalan di aplikasi yang diinstall dari Play Store. iOS tidak butuh SHA-1.': 'Open "Set up Firebase" again → step 5 "Register SHA-1". After that Google Sign-In also works in the Play Store install. iOS needs no SHA-1.',
  'Simpan & buat AAB': 'Save & build AAB',
  'Buat file AAB / IPA sekarang (tanpa upload)': 'Build the AAB / IPA file now (no upload)',
  'Proyek disimpan, lalu DeployHub menjalankan pub get → analyze → test → flutter build appbundle --release. Hasil: build/app/outputs/bundle/release/app-release.aab, lengkap dengan laporan AAB (perangkat, R8, yang kurang). Tidak ada yang dikirim ke Google Play / Apple.': 'The project is saved, then DeployHub runs pub get → analyze → test → flutter build appbundle --release. Output: build/app/outputs/bundle/release/app-release.aab, with the AAB report (devices, R8, what is missing). Nothing is sent to Google Play / Apple.',
  'Buat AAB / IPA': 'Build AAB / IPA',
  'Tambahkan project Flutter kamu, mis. Batam ChitChat. Nama, package, dan repo GitHub terisi otomatis dari folder project. Setelah itu kamu bisa langsung "Buat AAB" (tanpa upload) atau "Deploy ke Play Store".': 'Add your Flutter project, e.g. Batam ChitChat. Name, package and GitHub repo are filled from the project folder. Then you can "Build AAB" (no upload) or "Deploy to Play Store" right away.',
  'Tambah proyek dulu': 'Add a project first',
  'Untuk membuat AAB, DeployHub perlu tahu folder project Flutter-nya. Pilih foldernya sekali (nama, package, signing terdeteksi otomatis), lalu file AAB langsung dibuat.': 'To build an AAB, DeployHub needs the Flutter project folder. Pick it once (name, package, signing are detected automatically), then the AAB is built.',
  'Pilih folder project': 'Choose project folder',
  'Buat file AAB / IPA': 'Build AAB / IPA file',
  'Hanya build, tidak ada yang diupload': 'Build only, nothing is uploaded',
  'File AAB (Android)': 'AAB file (Android)',
  'Dibuat di PC ini. Hasil: build/app/outputs/bundle/release/app-release.aab + laporan AAB.': 'Built on this PC. Output: build/app/outputs/bundle/release/app-release.aab + AAB report.',
