  'Perintah: flutter pub global activate flutterfire_cli. Butuh Flutter terbaca — kalau gagal, isi lokasi flutter di Pengaturan → Tools di PC.': 'Command: flutter pub global activate flutterfire_cli. Flutter must be found — if it fails, set the flutter location in Settings → Tools on PC.',
