  'Ganti akun': 'Switch account',
  'Login di Firebase Console (browser) BERBEDA dengan login Firebase CLI. CLI harus login sendiri lewat jendela terminal — sekali saja, setelah itu tersimpan di PC.': 'Being signed in to Firebase Console (browser) is NOT the same as Firebase CLI login. The CLI must sign in via the terminal window — once only, then it is saved on this PC.',
  'Yang terjadi setelah klik "Login Firebase":': 'What happens after clicking "Firebase login":',
  '1. Jendela terminal hitam terbuka. Kalau ada pertanyaan "Allow Firebase to collect CLI usage…?", ketik n lalu Enter.': '1. A black terminal window opens. If it asks "Allow Firebase to collect CLI usage…?", type n and press Enter.',
  '2. Browser terbuka → pilih akun Google pemilik Firebase → klik "Allow / Izinkan".': '2. The browser opens → choose the Google account that owns Firebase → click "Allow".',
  '3. Browser menampilkan "Firebase CLI Login Successful" dan terminal menulis "✔ Success! Logged in as …".': '3. The browser shows "Firebase CLI Login Successful" and the terminal prints "✔ Success! Logged in as …".',
  '4. DeployHub mengecek otomatis tiap 3 detik — langkah ini jadi hijau sendiri. Jendela terminal boleh ditutup.': '4. DeployHub checks every 3 seconds — this step turns green by itself. You can close the terminal window.',
