  'Keystore & key.properties dikirim terenkripsi ke GitHub Secrets repo ini (ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64, ANDROID_KEY_PROPERTIES) supaya GitHub Actions bisa membuat AAB release. File-nya tetap TIDAK masuk git. Simpan cadangan keystore di tempat aman — kalau hilang, aplikasi tidak bisa diupdate.': 'The keystore & key.properties are sent encrypted to this repo\'s GitHub Secrets (ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64, ANDROID_KEY_PROPERTIES) so GitHub Actions can build a release AAB. The files themselves are still NOT committed. Keep a backup of the keystore somewhere safe — if it is lost, the app can no longer be updated.',
