  'Status rilis dipilih "draft" di dialog Deploy. Pilih "completed" supaya langsung dipublikasikan.': 'Release status "draft" was chosen in the Deploy dialog. Choose "completed" to publish right away.',
  'Penyebab: aplikasi masih berstatus Draf di Play Console (belum pernah dipublikasikan). Aturan Google: lewat API, aplikasi Draf hanya boleh menerima rilis draft — ini bukan error DeployHub.': 'Cause: the app is still a Draft in Play Console (never published). Google rule: through the API, a Draft app only accepts draft releases — this is not a DeployHub error.',
  'Solusi (SEKALI saja): Play Console → Uji dan rilis → Pengujian internal → rilis draft → Simpan dan publikasikan. Setelah itu upload berikutnya langsung terpublikasi otomatis.': 'Fix (ONCE): Play Console → Test and release → Internal testing → draft release → Save and publish. After that, the next uploads are published automatically.',
