  'versionCode {0} DIPUBLIKASIKAN ke track "{1}"': 'versionCode {0} PUBLISHED to track "{1}"',
  'terpublikasi': 'published',
  'Rilis pertama: aplikasi masih Draf di Play Console. Google hanya mengizinkan rilis draft lewat API untuk aplikasi Draf, jadi setelah upload klik "Simpan dan publikasikan" di Play Console SEKALI. Upload berikutnya langsung terpublikasi otomatis.': 'First release: the app is still a Draft in Play Console. Google only allows draft releases through the API for Draft apps, so after the upload click "Save and publish" in Play Console ONCE. Later uploads are published automatically.',
  'AAB sudah terupload sebagai DRAFT — belum dipublikasikan. Aplikasi ini masih berstatus Draf di Play Console, dan aturan Google mengharuskan publikasi pertama diklik manual. Buka Play Console → Pengujian internal → Simpan dan publikasikan (sekali saja). Upload berikutnya akan langsung terpublikasi.': 'The AAB was uploaded as a DRAFT — not published yet. This app is still a Draft in Play Console, and Google requires the first publish to be clicked manually. Open Play Console → Internal testing → Save and publish (once). Later uploads will be published right away.',
